# Source-only repo for the VB6 AutoBack project.
# Keep VB6 source, including binary source resources (.frx, .ctx, .res),
# and the backup-job config files (copyfile/otherfile/deletefile .txt, .ini, .bat).

# --- Compiled / build output ---
*.exe
*.dll
*.ocx
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.tlb
*.olb

# --- VB6 per-user / source-control cruft ---
*.vbw
*.scc
mssccprj.scc
vssver*.scc

# --- Installers / archives ---
*.msi
*.cab
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar

# --- Databases / data files ---
*.mdb
*.accdb
*.ldb
*.laccdb
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.sqb

# --- Logs / temp / OS junk ---
log/
*.log
*.bak
*.old
*.tmp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*
